*  badgoto.sno -- branch to a label that is not there.
*  ERRORS: NOWHERE is not a label of this program. Error 24, and it is
*  found at run time rather than at compile time -- the line before it
*  prints first, which is how you can tell.
*  Part of github.com/mdhender/sil. BSD 2-Clause; see LICENSE.
-LIST
        OUTPUT = 'this line runs'               :(NOWHERE)
        OUTPUT = 'this line does not'
END
